OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe COW ident was a revelation. In many
OL,7,Frespects, it represents timeless
OL,8,Felegance. A simple design which was
OL,9,Fbeautifully executed using what was
OL,10,Fthen cutting edge equipment.
OL,23,APub: 16-Feb-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
